name: "Jitter axis (JITT)"
excerpt: "An axis found in some variable fonts that can be used to apply irregular displacement to glyphs, emulating the mechanical imperfections of vintage printing equipment."
related_lessons: "introducing_variable_fonts"
related_lessons: "designing_with_variable_fonts_in_desktop_apps"
